    "statement": "At every one of the 48 archived split fibers, the rowwise degree8 space generated by Sym1 D7, Sym2 B6, grad A1 and grad A2 contributes only inherited Hilbert-Burch syzygies. Adjoining Sym1 times the second derivatives of the selected A0 enlarges that space to dimension33 and contributes exactly one non-inherited quotient class. Canonical reduction modulo the inherited64-plane reproduces the normalized G3FN O8 column exactly."
